00:01:32.082 --> 00:01:37.246
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:38.446
Bedtime!

19
00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:44.728
Did you know? Sleep helps your brain turn today's lessons into long-term memories!

20
00:01:44.778 --> 00:01:46.905
Wow! I did not know that!

21
